  "question": "What park can I find within 80 kilometers of Ulrich Wildlife Preserve, Morton, IL toward the southeast?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.490228 40.649994)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.490228 40.649994)',4326)::geography, 80000)\nAND leisure = 'park'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 112.5 AND 157.5;\n",
